# infra/docker/Dockerfile.dockerignore — applies to builds using infra/docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile; a plain .dockerignore here would be ignored because
# the build context is the repo root). Keeps secrets and junk out of the build context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/supabase/.temp
.npm-cache
.git
*.md
